# KDE colour scheme in the waybar palette, for programs built on KDE's libraries
# (Gwenview, Konsole, KDE Connect): they take view backgrounds and icon colours from
# here, not from the Qt style. Linked into ~/.local/share/color-schemes and copied
# into ~/.config/kdeglobals by theme/install.sh.

